:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Lesson Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-swimming-lesson-check'>>
  <<set _swimmingPoolSafe to Boolean(maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation')) and $location is 'pool'
    and C.npc.Mason.init is 1 and C.npc.Mason.state is 'active'
    and !$combat and !$statFreeze and !$replayScene and !$possessed
    and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced
    and $stress lt $stressmax and !isPregnancyEnding()>>
  <<set _swimmingLessonSafe to _swimmingPoolSafe
    and Time.schoolDay and Time.hour is 14 and $schoolstate is 'fifth' and $poolroomstate is 'own'
    and !($swimnudecounter gte 10 and $swimall isnot 1 and !maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').school.allowsNudity)>>
  <<set _swimmingLessonReady to _swimmingLessonSafe and Time.minute lt 59 and $phase is 0>>
  <<set _swimmingPrivateReady to _swimmingPoolSafe and Time.schoolDay
    and ((Time.hour is 14 and Time.minute gte 45) or Time.hour is 15)
    and ($DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.coached or $DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.requested)>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 无固定目标的链接先重验课堂。同一个面板的重复点击不排入多次跳转。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice'>>
  <<set _swimmingChoiceTarget to _args[1], _swimmingChoiceSource to $passage, _swimmingChoiceUsed to false>>
  <<capture _swimmingChoiceTarget _swimmingChoiceSource _swimmingChoiceUsed>>
    <<lanLink _args[0]>>
      <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
      <<if !_swimmingChoiceUsed and !_swimmingLessonNavigating and _swimmingLessonReady and $passage is _swimmingChoiceSource>>
        <<set _swimmingChoiceUsed to true>>
        <<set _swimmingLessonNavigating to true>>
        <<goto _swimmingChoiceTarget>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>>
  <</capture>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-swimming-lesson-link'>>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
  <<if _swimmingLessonReady>>
    <<icon 'school/swimming-practice.png'>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Adjust your practice', '调整练习内容']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Practice'>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-school-pool-private-link'>>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
  <<if _swimmingPoolSafe and Time.schoolDay and ((Time.hour is 14 and Time.minute gte 45) or (Time.hour is 15 and Time.minute lte 10))
    and (C.npc.Mason.love gte 15 or C.npc.Mason.lust gte 15 or $DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.requested)
    and !$DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.coached>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink `['Stay behind for private coaching with Mason', '留下来接受梅森的课后单独辅导']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Private'>><<set $DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.coached to true>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-swimming-lesson-return'>>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
  <<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink `['Continue', '继续']` `$nextPassage || $nextPassageCheck`>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif _swimmingLessonReady>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the swimming lesson', '返回游泳课'] 'Swimming Lesson'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif $location is 'pool'>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the pool', '返回泳池'] 'School Pool'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif $safePassage>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] $safePassage>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 沿用 swimminglessoneffects 的原生课时、负担和事件宏。
     课终按 Focus 的互斥更衣分支，避免 exposed 与 swimall 同时成立时重复输出入口。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-swimming-lesson-effects'>>
  <<set $_swimmingPractice to _args[0], _swimmingPracticeSource to $passage>>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
  <<if !_swimmingLessonReady>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<advancelesson>>
  <<stress _lesson_progress>><<tiredness _lesson_progress>>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
  <<if $passage isnot _swimmingPracticeSource>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if !_swimmingLessonSafe>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Your practice is interrupted before you can finish the exercise.' '你还没完成这组练习，就被别的事打断了。'>><br><br>
    <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>
    <<exit>>
  <</if>>
  <<physique 3>><<swimmingskilluse>>
  <<if $_swimmingPractice is 'mason'>><<stress -1>><<lstress>><<elseif $_swimmingPractice is 'handson' or $_swimmingPractice is 'flaunt' or $_swimmingPractice is 'underwater'>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $phase is 1>>
    <<set $phase to 0>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The bell rings. Mason calls the class out of the water and directs everyone towards the changing rooms.' '下课铃响了。梅森招呼全班上岸，让大家前往更衣室。'>><br><br>
    <<if $exposed lte 0>><<destinationpoolchangingroom>><<else>><<destinationpoolchangingroom 'towels'>><</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<set _mod to $exposed gte 1 ? 1 : 0.2>>
    <<if dangerEvent(_mod, 8900)>><<eventsswimming>><<else>><<eventsswimmingsafe>><</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Practice
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is no time for another exercise in this lesson now.' '现在无法在这堂课上开始另一组练习。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Water slaps against the lane ropes as the class turns at the far wall. Mason watches from the side, occasionally calling a correction across the pool.
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      You can use the next part of the lesson to work on one movement at a time. The wall is close enough to stop and catch your breath.
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      You already keep a steady pace. A closer look at your technique might help you stop wasting effort between strokes and turns.
    <<else>>
      You can complete a length without stopping, but your breathing and turns do not always fit the rhythm of your strokes.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    同学们在对面的池壁转身，水波拍打着泳道线。梅森站在池边观察，不时隔着水面提醒谁调整动作。
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      接下来的课时可以用来逐个练习动作。池壁就在近处，累了便能停下来喘口气。
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      你已经能保持稳定的速度。仔细纠正泳姿，或许能减少划水与转身之间多余的动作。
    <<else>>
      你能不停歇地游完一趟，但换气和转身有时还跟不上划水的节奏。
    <</if>>
<</language>><br><br>

<<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Ask Mason to correct your technique', '请梅森纠正动作']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Guidance'>><<lstress>><<gswimming>><br>
<<swimmingicon>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Practise breathing and turns', '练习换气与转身']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Turns'>><<gswimming>><<gtiredness>><br>
<<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Ask Mason about pace and swimming strokes', '向梅森请教配速与泳姿']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Advice'>><<lstress>><br><br>

<<socialiseicon>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Ask Mason for hands-on posture guidance', '请求梅森下水贴身纠正姿势']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn'>><<gswimming>><<glust 'Mason'>><br>

<<if hasSexStat('exhibitionism', 1) or $exposed gte 1 or $swimall is 1>>
  <<swimicon 'back'>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Flaunt your body and swimwear at the poolside', '在池边向梅森展示身材与泳装']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Flaunt'>><<exhibitionist1>><<glust 'Mason'>><br>
<</if>>

<<if hasSexStat('promiscuity', 2) and C.npc.Mason.lust gte 10>>
  <<swimmingicon>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Dive underwater to stealthily tease Mason', '潜入水下悄悄对梅森恶作剧']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Underwater'>><<promiscuous2>><<gglust 'Mason'>><br>
<</if>>

<<if (C.npc.Mason.love gte 15 or C.npc.Mason.lust gte 15) and !$DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.coached and !$DeadwoodReblooms.daily.swimming.requested>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Ask Mason to stay behind after class for private coaching', '请梅森在下课后留下来单独辅导你']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Private Request'>><<glove>><<glust 'Mason'>><br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Advice
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Mason has to attend to the lesson. Your questions will have to wait.' '梅森得先照看课堂，你的问题只能稍后再问。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    "How fast should I be going?" you ask. Mason glances along the lane before answering, making sure no one is waiting to push off.
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      "Fast enough to keep moving. Not so fast that you forget to breathe." <<He>> points to the nearby wall. "Start with a short distance. Stop there when you need to. We can work on speed once you're comfortable."
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      "Try keeping the same pace all the way back," <<he>> says. "You start quickly, but your last few strokes get shorter. Save enough for the turn. You're doing well; you don't have to win every length."
    <<else>>
      "A pace you can repeat," <<he>> says. "If you need a long rest after every length, ease off a little. I'd rather see you finish the movement properly than rush it."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    You ask whether changing strokes would help. Mason starts to demonstrate with <<his>> arms, then draws them in to let a student pass. "Sorry. Not much room here. Each stroke takes practice. Pick one to work on first, and tell me which part is giving you trouble."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    “我该游多快？”你问。梅森沿泳道看了一眼，确认没有人在等着蹬壁出发，才回答你。
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      “能让身体向前就行，别快到忘了换气。”<<He>>指指近处的池壁。“先游一小段，需要时就在那里停下。等适应了，再练速度。”
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      “试着保持同样的速度游回来，”<<he>>说，“你起步很快，但最后几下划水会缩短。给转身留点力气。你游得不错，不用每一趟都争第一。”
    <<else>>
      “用你能反复保持的速度，”<<he>>说，“要是每游一趟都得休息很久，就稍微慢点。我宁愿看你把动作做完整，也不想让你一味求快。”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    你又问换一种泳姿是否会有帮助。梅森刚抬手准备示范，便收起手臂，让一名同学从旁边经过。“抱歉，这里有点挤。每种泳姿都得练习。先选一种，再告诉我哪个动作让你为难。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<swimmingicon>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-choice `['Return to the practice choices', '返回练习选项']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Practice'>><br>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Guidance
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Mason has the class move on. You cannot begin that exercise now.' '梅森已经让全班进行下一项安排，现在无法开始这组练习。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You wait at the wall until Mason looks your way, then ask <<him>> to watch your next length. <<He>> clears a little space beside the lane rope. "Go on. Take your time."
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      You lift your head too far when you breathe and lose your balance. Mason has you stay by the wall and practise breathing out into the water before trying a short distance again. This time you reach the wall without rushing the last few strokes.
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      Mason follows your strokes, then points out that one hand crosses too far inward as it enters the water. You repeat the length with a straighter reach. The change is small, but you no longer have to correct your direction with every other kick.
    <<else>>
      Mason asks you to slow down enough to finish each stroke before starting the next. You try again. The water still catches your face once, but the second length feels less hurried.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    "Keep working on that," Mason says before turning to another student. Having one clear correction to follow makes the practice easier to face.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在池壁边等梅森看过来，请<<him>>观察你接下来这一趟。<<He>>在泳道线旁留出一点空位。“来吧，慢慢游。”
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      你换气时把头抬得太高，身体跟着失去平衡。梅森让你留在池壁边，先练习在水里呼气，再重新游一小段。这次你游到池壁时，没有急着划完最后几下。
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      梅森看完你的划水，指出一只手入水时向内偏得太多。你伸直手臂，再游一趟。改动很小，却让你不用隔几下打腿便纠正一次方向。
    <<else>>
      梅森让你放慢一点，每次划水做完整后再接下一次。你重新试了一趟。水还是呛到脸上一次，但第二趟游得没那么仓促了。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    “继续练这个。”梅森说完，转身去看另一名同学。有了明确要改进的地方，练习也没那么让人紧张了。
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-effects 'mason'>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming Turns
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The class has moved on. You cannot begin that exercise now.' '课程已经进行到下一项安排，现在无法开始这组练习。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You choose a quiet stretch beside the lane rope. The wall clock ticks above the changing room doors while water spills into the gutter at the pool's edge.
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      You keep one hand on the wall, lower your face and breathe out slowly. Once that feels manageable, you push away for a few strokes, then return to touch the wall and turn. You need several rests, but the last attempt leaves you less breathless than the first.
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      You count your last few strokes before the wall and turn without pausing to look up. Your first push sends you slightly off line. On the next length you keep your feet more squarely against the wall, and carry the glide into your opening strokes.
    <<else>>
      You concentrate on breathing out before turning your head for air. At the wall you touch, draw your knees in and push back along the lane. You lose the rhythm a few times, but begin to join the movements without a long pause between them.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    The repeated pushes leave your legs tired. You ease the pace when Mason calls the next instruction.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在泳道线旁选了段不拥挤的水面。更衣室门上方的挂钟滴答作响，池水顺着边缘流进排水槽。
    <br><br>
    <<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') lte 300>>
      你一手扶着池壁，把脸浸入水里，慢慢呼气。等适应一些后，你蹬壁游出几下，再回来触壁转身。中间休息了好几次，但最后一次尝试不像起初那样喘不过气。
    <<elseif currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 700>>
      你数好触壁前最后几次划水，没有抬头停顿便转了身。第一次蹬壁时，方向偏了一点。下一趟你让双脚更稳地抵住池壁，将滑行顺畅地接进最初几次划水。
    <<else>>
      你专心在转头吸气前先把气呼出去。到了池壁便触壁、收腿，再蹬回泳道。节奏还是断了几次，但动作之间已经不必停顿那么久。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    反复蹬壁让双腿有些发酸。听见梅森发出下一项指令，你便放缓了速度。
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-effects 'turns'>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Mason has to attend to the class. Hands-on coaching will have to wait.' '梅森得先照看整个班级，贴身指导只能稍后再说了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You swim over to Mason and ask if <<he>> can physically support your waist in the water to help correct your hip buoyancy and kick alignment.
    <br><br>
    Mason blushes slightly, taken by surprise. "Hands-on? Well... keeping your hips up is crucial. Alright, let me get behind you. Try to stay relaxed."
    <br><br>
    Mason slides into the water and positions <<himself>> directly behind you. <<His>> large, firm hands reach around your waist, fingers pressing into the skin just above your hips to lift you into proper alignment. The water swirls around you, slick and warm against your contact points.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你游到梅森近旁，询问<<him>>能否下水用双手托住你的腰身，亲手纠正你下半身的漂浮与打腿姿态。
    <br><br>
    梅森微微一怔，耳根泛红。“贴身指导？嗯……保持髋部浮力确实很要紧。好吧，我到你身后去，试着放松身体。”
    <br><br>
    梅森滑入水中，来到你正后方。<<His>>宽大而结实的手掌环上你的腰肢，指腹稳稳抵住你腰侧的皮肤，将你向上托平。池水在你们身躯之间翻卷荡漾，相贴的肌肤在水流里滑腻而温热。
<</language>><br><br>

<<lanLink `['Focus obediently on your kicks with Mason\'s support', '在梅森的托扶下顺从练习打腿']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn Focus'>><</lanLink>><<gswimming>><<lstress>><br>

<<if hasSexStat('promiscuity', 1)>>
  <<lanLink `['Arch your hips and press back against Mason\'s hands', '有意弓起腰身，向后磨蹭梅森的双手']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn Arch'>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<glust 'Mason'>><<garousal>><br>
<</if>>

<<if hasSexStat('promiscuity', 2)>>
  <<lanLink `['Reach behind through the water and stroke Mason\'s arm', '反手伸向身后，在水下轻抚梅森结实的手臂']` 'Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn Touch'>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous2>><<gglust 'Mason'>><<ggarousal>><br>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn Focus
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>><<exit>><</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You follow Mason's instructions, kicking your feet in rhythmic flutters while supported by <<his>> broad palms beneath your waist. As the water churns between your bodies, the gentle sway of your hips rubs against <<his>> slick hands. Mason's fingers twitch with a sudden tightness before <<he>> catches <<himself>>, clearing <<his>> throat to steady <<his>> voice.
    <br><br>
    "Good, exactly like that," Mason murmurs, <<his>> ears tinged pink above the water. "Keep your hips up... feel how much easier it is?" <<He>> holds you firmly, never letting you sink while your breathing falls into rhythm with <<his>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你顺从梅森的指导，借着<<his>>托扶腰部的大手轻轻摆动双脚打腿。水流在你们相贴的肌肤间翻涌激荡，你腰肢的每一次轻微摆动都在<<his>>湿滑的掌心间反复摩挲。梅森的指节冷不防微微收紧了一瞬，随即像是猛然回过神来，喉结微动，强自稳住呼吸。
    <br><br>
    “很好，就是这样……”梅森压低了声音，露出水面的耳根泛起一层不易察觉的浅红，“保持这个姿势……是不是省力些了？”<<He>>的大手沉稳地托着你，始终没有让你的腰肢沉下去，两人在水波中的呼吸渐渐重合。
<</language>><br><br>
<<npcincr Mason love 1>><<npcincr Mason lust 1>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-effects 'handson'>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Swimming HandsOn Arch
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-swimming-lesson-check>>
<<if !_swimmingLessonReady>><<deadwood-swimming-lesson-return>><<exit>><</if>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You let your hips sink slightly, then deliberately arch your spine, rubbing the curve of your waist and backside firmly against Mason's wet hands and chest beneath the surface.
    <br><br>
    Mason's breath catches audibly in <<his>> throat. <<His>> fingers tighten reflexively against your waist, clutching your flesh with sudden intensity.
    <br><br>
    "W-what are you doing... keep your posture straight..." <<he>> stammers in a desperate whisper, <<his>> cheeks glowing bright crimson. Yet despite <<his>> words, <<his>> grip does not release you, and you feel the quickened thumping of <<his>> heart vibrating against your back through the water.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你故意让下半身微沉，随即柔媚地弓起腰背，让腰臀的饱满曲线在水下紧紧贴向梅森湿润的双掌与胸膛。
    <br><br>
